    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A collection of 4 click and point adventures inspired by Newgrounds\u00a0horror games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HUNTED: a strategy point and click adventure game where you need to collect objects and solve puzzles to secure yourself before a mysterious creature can break in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HUNTED 2: You wake up in a house in the middle of the woods, and you must collect objects, set traps, and find weapons to secure yourself Before Nightfall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HUNTED TO THE GRAVE: visit multiple locations in the day to collect Items to give yourself an edge at nighttime in a sit and survive inspired nightmare!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BURIED: you wake up in a bunker without your memories and a throbbing headache, find your way out before it's too late in this linear point and click puzzle adventure.</p>",
