        "notes": "In \"Hunted\" there is a dark room with a collectible step stool object and a rope creaking sound effect, but the room is too dark to see anything.\r\n\r\nIn \"Hunted 2\" you have the option to kill a rabid wolf.\r\n\r\nIn \"Hunted to the grave\" there are bloodied zombies and a Tamagotchi minigame where if you fail to properly tend to your companion, the screen will go black and will occasionally flicker to show her hanging with a compressed rope swing sound effect.\r\n\r\nIn \"Buried\" there are depictions of parasitic infections, torture, blood, and murder."
